---
// Distinct from EmptyDealsState: this renders when the feed itself has zero
// published deals (nothing has cleared the 50% bar right now), not when a
// visitor's filters happen to match nothing.
---

<div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white p-10 text-center">
  <p class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-700">No deals are live right now.</p>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
    We only publish drops of 50% or more, and only after a second check confirms the price. Nothing
    has cleared that bar in the last few hours — check back soon.
  </p>
</div>
